131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The COVID-19 pandemic spurred a global shift toward home workouts and virtual fitness apps like Peloton and Perfect Posture. While convenient, these solutions often lack real-time, exercise-specific form correction particularly for complex, high-risk movements such as the bench press, squat, and deadlift. Poor technique in these compound lifts can lead to serious injuries, yet most existing systems focus on general or single-joint exercises without phase-specific feedback. To bridge this gap, we introduce a real-time posture correction system that combines MediaPipe for landmark detection and YOLOv5 for exercise recognition. Powered by our custom PolyView Kinematic Dataset \(PKC\), which captures 3D joint coordinates across concentric and eccentric phases from multiple angles, the system provides detailed, real-time feedback to ensure safe and effective training.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
